  "storybookAuxiliary": [
    {
      "text": "a big bowl-shaped hole on the Moon",
      "path": "/audio/en/33d5be36-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "a small hand or claw that can hold things",
      "path": "/audio/en/3d477f7a-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "wrinkled from being bent or squeezed",
      "path": "/audio/en/1c70a845-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "an empty space inside a tree",
      "path": "/audio/en/f857b559-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "a tiny magical creature",
      "path": "/audio/en/4fdee2fa-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "to shine with a soft, moving light",
      "path": "/audio/en/33183c81-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "the part of a river where the water is not deep",
      "path": "/audio/en/58ed12da-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "rubbish left where it does not belong",
      "path": "/audio/en/018fd067-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "a person who helps care for a park and its animals",
      "path": "/audio/en/e4e45ea1-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A flower that grows on a tree or bush.",
      "path": "/audio/en/80314fee-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A sweet drink that some flowers make.",
      "path": "/audio/en/38873d36-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiny grains in flowers that can help some plants make fruit or seeds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/3517b198-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The soft light in the sky after the sun goes down.",
      "path": "/audio/en/c82d850b-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dark shape made when something blocks light.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fd39a693-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A group of people walking together for a celebration.",
      "path": "/audio/en/ecc59187-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "From high mountain places.",
      "path": "/audio/en/3849d301-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kept safe from strong wind or weather.",
      "path": "/audio/en/70c6350d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A new young stem growing from a seed or plant.",
      "path": "/audio/en/376fa139-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "To go back along the same way you travelled before.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fcfdab4e-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kept safe from rain or wind.",
      "path": "/audio/en/98600774-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "To use something for a while and return it later.",
      "path": "/audio/en/a3c101db-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What had Rex lost?",
      "path": "/audio/en/c44e757b-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rex had lost the star map that showed the way home.",
      "path": "/audio/en/0bbc061f-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rex reached into his pocket, but it was empty.",
      "path": "/audio/en/4514d685-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What clue did Pip spot?",
      "path": "/audio/en/1ef8c552-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pip spotted a sparkly map corner near the crater.",
      "path": "/audio/en/ab6e82ba-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pip saw something shiny near a big Moon crater.",
      "path": "/audio/en/9895a3c8-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "How did Rex and Pip get the map back?",
      "path": "/audio/en/c7ed70b1-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rex held Pip safely out so Pip could catch the map corner.",
      "path": "/audio/en/b10a5df4-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rex used his strength and Pip used a gripper.",
      "path": "/audio/en/8c732810-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Where did the whisper lead the friends?",
      "path": "/audio/en/b810b4de-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The friends followed the whisper to an ancient hollow tree.",
      "path": "/audio/en/9b6c5530-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A soft blue light glowed from somewhere among the tree roots.",
      "path": "/audio/en/051ba0fa-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What had trapped the wind sprite?",
      "path": "/audio/en/5926e928-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A heavy branch had fallen on the tiny wind sprite.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fbece504-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sprite was under something that had fallen.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fe08e57d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What happened after the friends freed the sprite?",
      "path": "/audio/en/969aac98-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The grateful sprite made flowers bloom and leaves shimmer.",
      "path": "/audio/en/cff312e0-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sprite flew through the woods and left a lovely change behind.",
      "path": "/audio/en/99ed28e8-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What litter did Nia find by the river?",
      "path": "/audio/en/e2c50c2f-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nia saw an old sack and empty bottles at the water’s edge.",
      "path": "/audio/en/67478978-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rubbish was caught among the reeds.",
      "path": "/audio/en/a203edad-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Who would collect the litter?",
      "path": "/audio/en/37164125-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The animals put the litter on dry ground for the park rangers.",
      "path": "/audio/en/0bc4ca87-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aunt Amara said to place it safely on dry ground.",
      "path": "/audio/en/ae5fd70b-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Why did Nia want to keep the river clean?",
      "path": "/audio/en/6108ee0a-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hippos, kingfishers, buffalo and elephants all need clean water.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fb32445d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nia met animals who lived by or drank from the river.",
      "path": "/audio/en/2bdab4e0-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What sweet drink did Bea sip?",
      "path": "/audio/en/b8fa8356-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bea sipped nectar, a sweet drink made by flowers.",
      "path": "/audio/en/22d8773d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gran named the sweet drink inside a flower.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f7ef75aa-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "How can pollen help some flowers?",
      "path": "/audio/en/4ea64568-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pollen reaching the right part of some flowers can help them begin to make fruit.",
      "path": "/audio/en/289c7b6f-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about what Gran said when pollen reaches another flower.",
      "path": "/audio/en/e58c5013-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "How did Bo stay safe while watching Bea?",
      "path": "/audio/en/6701abfb-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bo watched quietly from the path and did not touch the bee.",
      "path": "/audio/en/c2126011-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gran reminded Bo to leave bees alone.",
      "path": "/audio/en/10bba0c1-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Why did Sami’s lantern grow dim?",
      "path": "/audio/en/cd0a6275-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dad found that one battery had slipped out of place and fixed it carefully.",
      "path": "/audio/en/781f8f82-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dad opened the lantern’s battery cover.",
      "path": "/audio/en/6517529b-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What did Tavi do above the grass?",
      "path": "/audio/en/1b26cac9-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tavi the firefly blinked a small light above the grass.",
      "path": "/audio/en/4b964577-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sami watched the little light appear, pause, and appear again.",
      "path": "/audio/en/1fcc9818-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What order did Sami remember?",
      "path": "/audio/en/a8d52d6f-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sami remembered sunset first, then lanterns, stars, and bedtime.",
      "path": "/audio/en/fa8cc2f6-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sami named four parts of the evening on the way home.",
      "path": "/audio/en/5ffd0dcf-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Where did Mina plant the seed?",
      "path": "/audio/en/7ffa6c7d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mina planted the seed in a little pot on the mountain hut porch.",
      "path": "/audio/en/beda2cb2-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leni filled a small container with soil on the porch.",
      "path": "/audio/en/d8499f58-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What helps a seed begin to grow?",
      "path": "/audio/en/a7a12ec8-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leni said a seed needs water, air and warmth to begin growing.",
      "path": "/audio/en/2df9c7fc-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leni explained what seeds need before a shoot appears.",
      "path": "/audio/en/454ef36d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "How did Mina track the shoot’s growth?",
      "path": "/audio/en/e491ea7d-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mina drew the seedling and compared the drawing as it grew.",
      "path": "/audio/en/827cae6c-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mina made a picture and compared it with the plant later.",
      "path": "/audio/en/b71dadac-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What was missing from Kai’s tote bag?",
      "path": "/audio/en/2f2075a7-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kai’s borrowed picture book was missing from the tote bag.",
      "path": "/audio/en/f83a2e0a-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kai had borrowed something to read on a rainy afternoon.",
      "path": "/audio/en/329ec882-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Who noticed the book by the shelter?",
      "path": "/audio/en/7e468e34-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Noor noticed the blue book beside the dry bench at the bus shelter.",
      "path": "/audio/en/55627a17-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "A familiar neighbour was locking a red bicycle.",
      "path": "/audio/en/5dfbdede-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "What will help Kai carry the next book?",
      "path": "/audio/en/ff09d249-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kai put the next book into a zipped pocket inside the tote bag.",
      "path": "/audio/en/a21bafcf-matilda.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kai chose a safer place inside the tote bag at the end.",
      "path": "/audio/en/651fa15c-matilda.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
